  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A particular style of dance appeals to you. As a result, your performances are particularly difficult to resist.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dances class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a subtype of dance. Add +1 to the Difficulty Class for all saving throws against dances from the subtype you select.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Dance Focus multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new subtype of dances.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/primordial-dancer-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
